Changes made by TEX1G (2026) include, among others:
- runs as a ReShade add-on instead of a ScriptHookV script
- clean (UI-free) capture and ReShade preset rendering into the export
- motion blur accumulation in linear light, shutter angle, soft and rolling shutter
- depth, normals, clean plate, proxy, ID and HFR passes
- export progress display, finished notice, sidecar files, naming
- EVE1G Settings window and EVE1G.ini options
- frame-exact timing export for the Focus Puller ReShade add-on
- static build, new build scripts and many fixes

All files in this repository that come from Extended Video Export
have been modified.

